(2) Subject to sub-section (2) of section 106, the Central Government may, by notification, omit or add to any of the 20 of 45 Neutral Citation No:=2023:PHHC:048222 FAO-756-2022 and connected cases 2023:PHHC:048222 [21] enactments specified in the Fourth Schedule.
